  "escrow_capacity": "Sum open reservations from both slots in the shared industry ledger; floor for fuel tests only against unreserved spendable stock after the new manifest. Every active job independently releases or consumes its exact manifest in a single transaction.",
  "cancel": "before a settled receipt, release exact manifest without payout, even ready but not submitted. Capacity previously reserved. Compare status atomically; settled receipt forbids cancellation.",
  "command_scope": "Accept, cancel and settle carry the original run_id with operation_id; the active run is never inferred for a queued command. Account-wide earned bond stamps persist across resets. Use the shared industrial port ledger and reserved_returns per resource for escrow capacity.",
  "max_parallel_with_owned_slot": 2,
  "slot_policy": "1 gratis, second personal only after current M25 and 280-bond consent, persists through prestige. Two distinct sheets only. Losing second slot honors accepted jobs to finish/cancel; no replacement until total outstanding is under new limit.",
  "instant_policy": "25 bonds once per job for immediate normal delivery of frozen escrow and reward while positive remaining. No fee when ready; no reroll, board refresh is free. No extra stamp on repeat, no ranked commands. Different sheet grantees can claim one lifetime pair of bonds each.",
  "wall_clock": "Persist a monotonic high-water for trusted elapsed time, slot ids, remaining and visited intervals. Same-boot elapsed clock survives background; after reboot use trusted saved/confirmed time when available. Unknown time grants no progress for that gap; newly observed elapsed foreground/offline on a known boot resumes locally. Rollback, device clock jumps and repeated observations never add seconds. A natural due is checked before any paid command. Matured shipments wait safely for free manual delivery or cancel.",
  "late_cash": "S03–20 incl bounded service credit min(480,2*floor(wall_s/60)), baked into the cash quote shown. Template admits no payment-dependent reward. Stamp limited to 2 once/account/sheet."
}
